From: helmfile-enhancement-plan
Subject: [PATCH] PR-T-03 — Coverage gate (>=40% on dte/) + report upload

Closes G3 (no coverage report).
Branch: ci/dte-coverage-gate
Depends-on: PR-T-01, PR-T-02

Adds an explicit `coverage` and `coverage-report` Make target and pins
the L2 CI step's threshold at 40% (calibrated to whatever the first run
emits; raise to 60% after a quarter).

---
 atlassian_packages/gcp_kitt/helmfile/dte/Makefile | 13 +++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 13 insertions(+)

diff --git a/atlassian_packages/gcp_kitt/helmfile/dte/Makefile b/atlassian_packages/gcp_kitt/helmfile/dte/Makefile
--- a/atlassian_packages/gcp_kitt/helmfile/dte/Makefile
+++ b/atlassian_packages/gcp_kitt/helmfile/dte/Makefile
@@ -50,3 +50,16 @@ test-verbose: ## Run tests with verbose output
 	@echo "Running tests with verbose output..."
 	go test -race -v ./...

+.PHONY: coverage
+coverage: ## Run tests and emit coverage profile + summary line
+	@echo "Running tests with coverage..."
+	go test -race -coverprofile=coverage.out -covermode=atomic ./...
+	@go tool cover -func=coverage.out | tail -1
+
+.PHONY: coverage-report
+coverage-report: coverage ## Emit a human-readable HTML report at coverage.html
+	go tool cover -html=coverage.out -o coverage.html
+	@echo "Open dte/coverage.html in your browser."
+
+.PHONY: coverage-gate
+coverage-gate: coverage ## CI-suitable: exit non-zero if coverage drops below 40%
+	@go tool cover -func=coverage.out | awk '/total:/ { gsub("%",""); if ($$3+0 < 40.0) { print "FAIL: coverage "$$3"% < 40%"; exit 1 } else { print "OK: coverage "$$3"% >= 40%" } }'
